    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This three-bedroom detached bungalow offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a home in a highly desirable residential location on the Clare Road, Ennis. \r\nRequiring refurbishment and modernisation throughout, the property provides purchasers with the perfect blank canvas to create a home tailored to their own taste and requirements. \r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, living room, kitchen, three bedrooms and a family bathroom, with generous scope to reconfigure or upgrade. A detached garage to the side. \r\nOccupying a large and mature site of 0.15 hectares (0.37acres) in an established neighbourhood, the property combines the appeal of single-storey living with the opportunity to add significant value through renovation. Whether you're a first-time buyer, investor or someone looking to create your forever home, this property presents an exciting opportunity in a prime location. \r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the potential this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "The property enjoys an enviable position on the highly regarded Clare Road, one of Ennis' most established and convenient residential addresses. \r\nLocated just a short distance from Ennis Town Centre, residents benefit from easy access to an excellent range of amenities including schools, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, pharmacies, medical centres and leisure facilities. \r\nThe recently developed neighbourhood centre, anchored by Lidl, together with the West County Hotel, are both within walking distance, adding to the convenience of this superb location. \r\nExcellent transport links are also close at hand, with the M18 motorway providing straightforward access to Shannon, Limerick and Galway, while Shannon Airport is approximately a 20-minute drive away. \r\nCombining the convenience of town living with excellent connectivity and a wealth of nearby amenities, the Clare Road remains one of Ennis' most desirable residential locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing by prior appointment only with sole selling agents"
      }
    ],
